  culture: `<p>Almost every Cairo apartment building has a <i>bawwaab</i>, a doorman who lives on site, carries shopping, watches cars, knows everyone's business and is the best neighbourhood information source you will ever have. A tip (<i>ikramiyya</i>) at feasts is expected.</p>`,
